# 🎨 Global Application Capabilities & UI/UX Features

### 🌓 1. Dark Mode / Light Mode Theme System
* **Header Toggle Button:** Located in the top navigation bar for instant 1-click theme switching.
* **Persistent User Preference:** Theme choice is stored in local storage and user session.
* **Tailored High-Contrast Styling:** Custom admin CSS (`theme.css`) ensures every table row, form input, modal, badge, and report page renders in crisp high-contrast colors in both Light and Dark modes.

### 🌐 2. Dual Language & RTL Engine (Arabic / English)
* **Navbar Language Switcher:** Instant switcher between **Arabic (`ar`)** and **English (`en`)**.
* **Native RTL (Right-to-Left) Rendering:** When Arabic is selected (default), the sidebar flips to the right side, form fields align right, table columns flip, and icon directions adjust naturally.
* **Dynamic Database Translation:** Data models dynamically expose Arabic or English titles (`name_ar` / `name_en`) depending on active locale across all select menus, tables, and reports.

### 🖨️ 3. Direct Print & PDF Export Engine
* **Automated `@media print` Filtering:** Pressing `Ctrl + P` or clicking any Print button automatically strips away topbars, sidebars, search boxes, and table controls, rendering clean printable documents.
* **Printable Formats:** Custom layouts for **A5 Thermal/Impact Tuition Receipts**, **A4 Multi-Badge Student ID Cards**, **Official Graduation Certificates**, **Monthly Staff Salary Sheets**, and **Financial Statements**.

### 🔍 4. Global Search & Real-Time Notifications
* **Top-Bar Universal Search:** Instantly search across Students, Registrations, Courses, Staff, Invoices, and Receipts from anywhere in the system.
* **Database Notification System:** Topbar bell icon with **30-second background polling** for alerts (low inventory stock, upcoming batch completions, unsubmitted exam marks).

