## 🏢 Module 1: Dashboard & System Settings

### 1. Main Dashboard (`/admin`)
* **Widgets & Charts:**
  * **Stats Overview:** Live cards for Total Active Students, Current Month Revenues, Unpaid Tuition Arrears, and Open Cashbox Balance.
  * **Monthly Chart:** Revenue vs. Expenses bar chart.
  * **Registrations Trend:** Line graph tracking enrollment numbers over time.
  * **Batches Ending Soon:** List of class groups completing within 7–14 days.
  * **Pending Results:** Class groups awaiting final exam grade entry.
  * **Low Stock Warning:** Inventory items that dropped below reorder thresholds.
  * **Recent Activity Log:** Live feed of newly issued receipts, registrations, and expenses.
* **Navigation Destinations:** Clicking any widget card redirects directly to the corresponding filtered list page.

### 2. Institute Settings Page (`/admin/institute-settings`)
* **What you can do:**
  * Edit Institute Name in Arabic & English.
  * Upload official Institute Logo & Header/Footer letterhead banners.
  * Set next sequential receipt number seed (e.g. start receipts from `#10001`).
  * Configure default YER currency formatting and invoice terms/disclaimers.
  * **Actions:** Save Settings, Reset Counter Seed.

