## 🎓 Module 2: Student & Academic Management

### 3. Student Roster Page (`/admin/students`)
* **What you see:** Filterable table with Photo, Student Code, Full Name, Phone, Gender, Active Status, Total Enrollments Count, and Net Financial Balance.
* **Table Filters:** Active/Inactive status, Gender, Registration date range.
* **Header Actions:** **Create Student** button.
* **Row Actions (What you can do per student):**
  * 👁️ **View Student Profile** (navigates to `/admin/students/{id}`).
  * ✏️ **Edit Student Details** (navigates to `/admin/students/{id}/edit`).
  * 💳 **Print Account Statement** (opens printable party statement).
  * 🆔 **Print Student ID Card** (opens printable visual ID badge layout).
  * 🗑️ **Soft Delete Student** (with confirmation modal).

### 4. Create Student Page (`/admin/students/create`)
* **Form Sections:**
  * **Personal Data:** Full Name AR/EN, Gender, Birth Date, National ID / Passport #.
  * **Contact & Location:** Primary Phone, Secondary Phone, Email, Residential Address.
  * **Guardian Details:** Guardian Name, Relationship, Guardian Phone #.
  * **Photo:** Image file uploader with dynamic preview.
* **Actions:** Save & View, Save & Create Another, Cancel.

### 5. View Student Profile Page (`/admin/students/{id}`)
* **Header Actions:** Edit Student, Print ID Card, Quick Register (enroll student into new course), Print Statement.
* **Tabbed Views & Relation Tables:**
  * **Registrations Tab:** View all courses/diplomas this student enrolled in, remaining balance, and status. Direct action: Collect Payment, Void.
  * **Payment History Tab:** Complete list of all money receipts paid by this student with receipt numbers, dates, and amounts.
  * **Issued Books Tab:** Textbooks received by this student.
  * **Certificates Tab:** Academic certificates earned by this student.

### 6. Edit Student Page (`/admin/students/{id}/edit`)
* **What you can do:** Update any personal, contact, photo, or guardian information.

### 7. Registration Directory Page (`/admin/registrations`)
* **What you see:** Master table of all course/diploma registrations displaying Reg #, Student Name, Batch/Course, Price Snapshot, Total Paid, Remaining Balance, and Status (Active, Completed, Dropped, Suspended, Transferred).
* **Filters:** Course/Batch filter, Status filter, Payment Status (Fully Paid, Partial, Unpaid), Date Range.
* **Header Actions:** **New Registration** button (`/admin/registrations/create`).
* **Row Actions (Interactive Features):**
  * 💰 **Collect Payment Modal:** Opens inline payment popup. Select payment source (Cashbox / Bank / Wallet), enter amount YER, add notes. **Generates atomic sequential receipt voucher and posts balanced journal entry.**
  * 🧾 **Print Receipt:** Triggers browser print view for the payment voucher.
  * 🚫 **Void Registration Modal:** Opens modal requiring mandatory void reason. Reverses accounting journal entries and marks registration voided.
  * 🎓 **Issue Certificate Modal:** Input final grade/GPA and issue official certificate serial.
  * 🔄 **Transfer Registration:** Redirects to batch transfer flow.
  * 🆔 **Print Student Card:** Opens graphic student card preview.
  * 👁️ **View Registration Details** (`/admin/registrations/{id}`).
  * ✏️ **Edit Registration Details** (`/admin/registrations/{id}/edit`).

### 8. New Registration Page (`/admin/registrations/create`)
* **Form Inputs:**
  * **Student Picker:** Select existing student or click `+ Quick Add Student` modal.
  * **Enrollment Type:** Select Short Course or Diploma Batch.
  * **Course Batch Picker:** Selecting a batch auto-populates live course price into fee snapshot.
  * **Price Snapshot & Discount:** Editable original fee, flat or % discount, auto-calculated net agreed tuition.
  * **Immediate Down Payment (Optional):** Enter initial collected cash, select Cashbox/Bank account to issue receipt immediately.
  * **Date Range:** Start Date & Expected Completion Date (auto-calculated).
* **Actions:** Submit Registration, Cancel.

### 9. View Registration Page (`/admin/registrations/{id}`)
* **What you see:** Full breakdown of fee snapshot, discounts, month tracking, payment history timeline, journal entry links, and certificate status.

### 10. Edit Registration Page (`/admin/registrations/{id}/edit`)
* **What you can do:** Modify start/end dates, adjust notes, or update referral info.

### 11. Enrollment Transfers Directory (`/admin/enrollment-transfers`)
* **What you see:** History of student batch transfers (Source Batch ➔ Target Batch, Transfer Date, Financial balance carried over).
* **Header Actions:** **New Enrollment Transfer** (`/admin/enrollment-transfers/create`).

### 12. Create Enrollment Transfer Page (`/admin/enrollment-transfers/create`)
* **Form Inputs:** Select Student Registration, Select Target Compatible Batch, Transfer Reason Notes, Financial Adjustment Balance options.
* **Actions:** Process Transfer (carries over student balance and updates batch rosters).

